{"unit_id":"tag:070R:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。景（sites）的每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>，列于拓扑（Topologies），第<REF_0001>节，都成为带环结构的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）。具体地，这些景（sites）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003>或<MATH_0004>都由连续的（continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0005>给出。因此，给定<MATH_0006>，令<MATH_0007>为通常的映射（map）<MATH_0008>。类似地，态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，对于<MATH_0010>，见拓扑（Topologies），引理<REF_0002>及<REF_0003>，成为环拓扑斯态射（morphism of ringed topoi），因为<MATH_0011>。下面是一些特殊情形：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 大景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>成为带环结构的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，如景上的模（Modules on Sites），定义<REF_0004>所述。大句法平坦（syntomic）、光滑（smooth）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）及Zariski景（sites）也类似。\n<STRUCT_0003> 小（small）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>成为带环结构的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>，如景上的模（Modules on Sites），定义<REF_0005>所述。小Zariski景（small Zariski site）也类似。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"带环结构的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"环拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"大景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"带环结构的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法平坦"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"带环结构的"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小Zariski景"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"基底态射的对象；待批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"景及概形的态射；待批准"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所列景态射；待批准"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"带环或小景；待批准"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"大景","context":"明确为big sites，中文保留大小限定；待批准"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"所引章节；待批准"},{"source_term":"ringed","target_term":"带环结构的","context":"景上的环结构；待批准"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续的","context":"给出景态射的函子；待批准"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"基底变换函子；待批准"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"结构层之间的映射；待批准"},{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"环拓扑斯态射","context":"小景到大景的环拓扑斯态射；待批准"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模","context":"所引章节；待批准"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法平坦","context":"拓扑名称的暂译；待批准"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"拓扑名称；待批准"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"保留原受保护重音的拓扑名称；待批准"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小","context":"景的大小限定；待批准"},{"source_term":"small Zariski site","target_term":"小Zariski景","context":"小景版本；待批准"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03DV:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为Zariski覆盖（Zariski covering），使有正合序列（exact sequences）<MATH_0002>，其中<MATH_0003>及<MATH_0004>为某些指标集（sets）。这是可行的，依据是环空间（ringed space）上拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）的定义（见模（Modules），定义<REF_0001>）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>（1）的证明。设<MATH_0005>。清楚的是，<MATH_0006>也位于正合序列（exact sequence）<MATH_0007>中。因此，<MATH_0008>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），依据是景上的模（Modules on Sites），引理<REF_0002>。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>（2）的证明。设<MATH_0009>。清楚的是，<MATH_0010>也位于正合序列（exact sequence）<MATH_0011>中。因此，<MATH_0012>是拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent），依据是景上的模（Modules on Sites），引理<REF_0003>。情形<MATH_0013>类似（实际上，这确实是重言式的，因为相应的环拓扑斯（ringed topoi）一致）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski覆盖"},{"source_term":"exact sequences","target_term":"正合序列"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"指标集"},{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"环空间"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合序列"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚的"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合序列"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚的"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","target_term":"景上的模"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski覆盖","context":"局部呈示的覆盖；待批准"},{"source_term":"exact sequences","target_term":"正合序列","context":"拟凝聚层的局部呈示；待批准"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"指标集","context":"此处明确是index sets，中文包含指标限定；待批准"},{"source_term":"ringed space","target_term":"环空间","context":"源定义所在的环空间；待批准"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"源模层的性质；待批准"},{"source_term":"Modules","target_term":"模","context":"所引章节；待批准"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合序列","context":"相伴层的局部呈示；待批准"},{"source_term":"Modules on Sites","targ